<view class="container">
  <view class="balance-card">
    <view class="label">可提现余额 (元)</view>
    <view class="amount">{{wallet.available_balance || '0.00'}}</view>
    <view class="stats-row">
      <view class="stat-item">
        <text class="stat-label">总收入</text>
        <text class="stat-value">¥{{wallet.total_income || '0.00'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="stat-item">
        <text class="stat-label">已提现</text>
        <text class="stat-value">¥{{wallet.withdrawn_amount || '0.00'}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="withdraw-section">
    <view class="section-title">提现金额</view>
    <view class="input-group">
      <text class="currency">¥</text>
      <input 
        class="amount-input" 
        type="digit" 
        placeholder="请输入提现金额" 
        value="{{withdrawAmount}}"
        bindinput="onAmountInput"
      />
      <view class="all-btn" bindtap="handleWithdrawAll">全部提现</view>
    </view>
    <view class="tips">单笔提现 0.10~200 元</view>
    <view class="today-tip">今日已提现 {{todayWithdrawCount}}/10 次，单日累计上限 ¥2,000</view>
    
    <button 
      class="withdraw-btn" 
      disabled="{{!canWithdraw}}" 
      bindtap="handleWithdraw"
      loading="{{submitting}}"
    >
      确认提现
    </button>
  </view>
  
  <view class="notice">
      <view class="notice-title">提现规则</view>
      <view class="notice-item">1. 结算周期：订单完成24小时后，服务费计入"总收入"</view>
      <view class="notice-item">2. 可提现余额：已结算金额，实时更新。单笔提现金额¥0.10~¥200，单日累计提现上限¥2,000。</view>
      <view class="notice-item">3. 提现次数：每日最多可提现10次（以自然日00:00重置）。</view>
      <view class="notice-item">4. 申请时间：全天 0:00-24:00 均可提交提现申请，无时段限制。</view>
      <view class="notice-item">5. 到账时效：提交后系统自动处理（无需人工审核），资金实时到账微信零钱，最长不超过2小时。</view>
  </view>
</view>
